<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-JAPAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-JAPAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $1.22 million Japan Open tennis championships on Tuesday (Prefix denotes seedings):</p>
<p>Men's first round</p>
<p>Neville Godwin (South Africa) beat Andrei Pavel (Romania) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Justin Gimbelstob (U.S.) beat Fernon Wibier (Belgium) 6-4 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Paes Leander (India) 7-6 (7-4) 6-1</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Orlin Stanoytchev (Bulgaria) 3-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Frederik Fetterlein (Denmark) beat Goichi Motomura (Japan) 3-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat Jerome Golmard (France) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Rasvan Sabau (Romania) beat Thomas Shimada (Japan) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Joost Winnink (Netherlands) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Henrik Holm (Sweden) beat Michael Joyce (U.S.) 4-6 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Eysal Ran (Israel) beat Lars Jonsson (Sweden) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Daniel Nestor (Canada) beat David Skoch (Slovakia) 6-1 6-7 (2-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Hideki Kaneko (Japan) beat Tamer El Sawy (Egypt) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Satoshi Iwabuchi (Japan) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Andrew Richardson (Britain) beat Tomas Nydahl (Sweden) 3-6 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Andrei Cherkasov (Russia) beat Daniel Vacek (Czeck Republic) 6-3 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Lionel Roux (France) beat David Adams (South Africa) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Men's second round</p>
<p>2-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Sebastien Lareau (Canada) 6-2 4-6 6-2</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Rasvan Sabau (Romania) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Women's first round</p>
<p>Janet Lee (U.S.) beat Misumi Miyauchi (Japan) 4-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>3-Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat Yuko Hosoki (Japan) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Mana Endo (Japan) beat Nana Miyagi (Japan) 6-0 6-2</p>
<p>6-Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) beat Jane Chi (U.S.) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>7-Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) beat Kim Eun-ha (South Korea) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Karin Kschwendt (Austria) beat Elena Tatarkova (Russia) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Jolene Watanabe (U.S.) beat Nirupana Valdyanathan (India) 7-5 4-6 6-0  </p>
<p>Men's first round</p>
<p>Shuzo Matsuoka (Japan) beat 11-Alex Radulescu (Germany) 7-5 6-7 (3-7) 6-4</p>
<p>12-Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Kevin Ullyett (U.S.) 7-6 (7-3) 2-6 7-5</p>
</text>
